Да, это уже тот момент, когда компонент начинает окупаться.

Добавь рядом с `person-card` ещё один компонент для основателей.

```clojure
(defn founder-card [photo name]
  [:div {:class "bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow text-center
                  hover:shadow-xl transition"}

   [:img
    {:src photo
     :alt name
     :class "w-40 h-40 mx-auto mb-4
             rounded-full
             object-cover"}]

   [:h3 {:class "font-semibold text-lg"}
    name]])
```

Тогда твой `founders-section` станет примерно таким:

```clojure
[:div
 {:class "grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8"}

 [founder-card
  "img/ueava-about-peaceful.webp"
  "Founder Name"]

 [founder-card
  "img/ueava-about-peaceful.webp"
  "Founder Name"]

 [founder-card
  "img/ueava-about-peaceful.webp"
  "Founder Name"]

 [founder-card
  "img/ueava-about-peaceful.webp"
  "Founder Name"]]
```

Или ещё лучше — через данные:

```clojure
(def founders
  [{:name "Founder 1"
    :photo "img/ueava-about-peaceful.webp"}

   {:name "Founder 2"
    :photo "img/ueava-about-peaceful.webp"}

   {:name "Founder 3"
    :photo "img/ueava-about-peaceful.webp"}

   {:name "Founder 4"
    :photo "img/ueava-about-peaceful.webp"}])
```

И рендер:

```clojure
[:div
 {:class "grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8"}

 (for [{:keys [name photo]} founders]
   ^{:key name}
   [founder-card photo name])]
```

