I'll show you the precise edits first (diff-style, so you can apply them quick), then drop the **full updated `src/ueava/pages/conferences.cljs`** like you asked. I kept the hero + intro text, made the archive cards pretty with photo backgrounds (dark overlay), external Google Drive links, bilingual support nicer, and cleaned up the card into its own reusable function. For the latest (2026) one, I made it stand out a bit with the short report text placeholder – Darina can fill it later.

